# by default. Point the script at wherever it is to re-cut theme/{menu,music}/*.ogg

# and neither is `puyo-rusto/art/sfx.py`'s: the Puyo Puyo Tetris 2 sound effect rip, 33 MiB
# of WAVs in twelve .acb folders, which the script expects to find beside itself
/puyo-rusto/art/Nintendo Switch - Puyo Puyo Tetris 2 - Sound Effects - Sound Effects/
